['Here is C code that generates three random integers larger than 1000, print them and their sum. The output of the program should be as described in the problem statement. Please note that because the standard library functions `rand()` and `srand()` are used here to generate pseudo-random numbers, these will not produce very high quality randomness. If you need higher quality randomness, please use a different method or library which provides this feature.

